   "seed": 383372480,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 931846999,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Three wires, that's all:\n\n1.  GND (top right)   →  probe contact            (black)\n2.  pin 1              →  other probe contact      (green)\n      the resistor also connects to this wire\n3.  resistor's free leg  →  3V3 (top LEFT)         (red)\n\nPin 1 wire is the only one with a branch on it.\n\nBreadboard: holes in the same short row are joined,\nso the board must straddle the centre gap.\n\nWorking:  t0 ≈ 20–25 °C,  meter pin 1 → GND ≈ 1.6 V",
   "originalText": "Three wires, that's all:\n\n1.  GND (top right)   →  probe contact            (black)\n2.  pin 1              →  other probe contact      (green)\n      the resistor also connects to this wire\n3.  resistor's free leg  →  3V3 (top LEFT)         (red)\n\nPin 1 wire is the only one with a branch on it.\n\nBreadboard: holes in the same short row are joined,\nso the board must straddle the centre gap.\n\nWorking:  t0 ≈ 20–25 °C,  meter pin 1 → GND ≈ 1.6 V",
   "fontSize": 20,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  }
 ],
